{"uid":"e182d40882b20c03","name":"test_toolkit_credential_indicators_e2e","fullName":"tests.ui.toolkits.test_toolkit_indicators_for_credentials.TestToolkitCredentialIndicators#test_toolkit_credential_indicators_e2e","historyId":"5cd132244d8cc3b064b41a9ff6a505a2","time":{"start":1783347318556,"stop":1783347341307,"duration":22751},"description":"E2E test: verify all indicators and fix invalid credentials on Toolkit.\n\n        Flow:\n        1. Create Jira credential with invalid token\n        2. Create toolkit with that credential\n        3. Verify all indicators:\n           - Status indicator with \"Authentication failed:\" tooltip\n           - Warning message with \"Authentication failed:\" text\n           - Reload button with \"Reload and apply changes\" tooltip\n           - Open in new tab button with \"Open in new tab\" tooltip\n           - Save button is disabled\n        4. Click \"Open in new tab\" and verify new tab opens\n        5. Fix credential via API\n        6. Close the new tab and return to original\n        7. Click Reload\n        8. Verify after fix:\n           - Status indicator gone\n           - Warning message gone\n           - Reload button gone\n           - Open in new tab remains\n           - Save button enabled\n        ","descriptionHtml":"<p>E2E test: verify all indicators and fix invalid credentials on Toolkit.</p>\n<pre><code>    Flow:\n    1. Create Jira credential with invalid token\n    2. Create toolkit with that credential\n    3. Verify all indicators:\n       - Status indicator with &quot;Authentication failed:&quot; tooltip\n       - Warning message with &quot;Authentication failed:&quot; text\n       - Reload button with &quot;Reload and apply changes&quot; tooltip\n       - Open in new tab button with &quot;Open in new tab&quot; tooltip\n       - Save button is disabled\n    4. Click &quot;Open in new tab&quot; and verify new tab opens\n    5. Fix credential via API\n    6. Close the new tab and return to original\n    7. Click Reload\n    8. Verify after fix:\n       - Status indicator gone\n       - Warning message gone\n       - Reload button gone\n       - Open in new tab remains\n       - Save button enabled\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"_verify_url","time":{"start":1783345746516,"stop":1783345746517,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"pytestconfig","time":{"start":1783345746516,"stop":1783345746516,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"delete_output_dir","time":{"start":1783345746516,"stop":1783345746516,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"base_url","time":{"start":1783345746516,"stop":1783345746516,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"browser","time":{"start":1783345746517,"stop":1783345752031,"duration":5514},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"auth_state","time":{"start":1783345752031,"stop":1783345752836,"duration":805},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_browser_cookies","time":{"start":1783345752836,"stop":1783345756042,"durat